    "truthbar_subset_of_in_ep_violations": 0,
    "note": "truthbar-FP := protein_homologous AND id_ok AND cov_ok, so truthbar is a SUBSET of in_ep BY CONSTRUCTION. '100% of the E_r win preserved by the protein route at zero cost' is therefore TAUTOLOGICAL (0 violations is definitional). Read it as 'zero cost to the protein-homologous PROXY of the win.' Non-protein-homologous divergent paralogs are definitionally binned 'genuine' and CUT; the 97 protein-missed TP prove that category is non-empty, so the 'genuine' count is an UPPER BOUND on true over-merges and the recall of non-protein paralogs is UNMEASURED."
  },
